<title>USA: Tinicum group cuts Kollmorgen stake.</title>
<headline>Tinicum group cuts Kollmorgen stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Tinicum Investors and RIT Capital Partners plc said Tuesday it reduced its stake in Kollmorgen Corp to 5.9 percent or 574,457 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 120,000 shares of Kollmorgen between August 1 and September 24 at prices ranging from $11.565 to $12.875 a share.</p>
</text>
